            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sonja"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My wonderful husband made this for a birthday/dance party we were going to. This was a HIT! People woofed it down. Great mix of flavors. Used 1 t. of salt; 1 T would have been WAY too much! Make this NOW!",
            "datePublished": "2017-05-11T02:14:51.957Z"
          },
