              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Seddy12"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Amazing! Only suggestion is less salt. We halved the salt and it was still too much ( and this is coming from a girl who lives salty). Wondering if maybe the recipe called for 1 tsp instead of 1 tbsp. This is delicious though. The mango really adds something special.",
